Package: mos-apid
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: mos build <mos@example.invalid>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: mosd (= @VERSION@), ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: mos API daemon
 Serves the web dashboard over HTTPS and makes every state change through
 mosd's D-Bus interface rather than by touching the system itself.
 .
 The dependency on mosd is pinned to the exact version because the two are
 built from one workspace commit and speak an interface that carries no
 compatibility promise across commits. The unit ships disabled.
